sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-nakamasu-zebrafish-three-cell-stripes> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-nakamasu-zebrafish-three-cell-stripes-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-nakamasu-zebrafish-three-cell-stripes-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Nakamasu et al. (2009) 3-variable zebrafish pigment-cell reaction-diffusion network, laser-ablation polarity & leopard (cx41.8) spot-to-stripe morphospace — MorphoEval overall 92.1/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) post-remediation evaluation of `2009-nakamasu-zebrafish-three-cell-stripes.py` (overall weighted score: 92.1 / 100, up +42.3 points from 49.8 / 100 in Pass 1). The remediated script integrates the nonlinear 3-species Nakamasu et al. (2009) reaction-diffusion PDE for melanophores (u), xanthophores (v), and long-range diffusible survival factor (w) with zero-flux Neumann boundary conditions via a spectral DCT-II IMEX solver; reproduces in silico laser-ablation experiments (83.4% melanophore loss upon flanking xanthophore interstripe ablation and boundary-guided horizontal stripe regeneration); sweeps the 4-regime *leopard* (cx41.8 / gja5b) spot-to-labyrinth-to-stripe morphospace; verifies dual negative controls (equal diffusion Dw = Du = 0.02 and ablated mutual repulsion bu = av = 0); segments 4 trunk melanophore stripes and interstripes on a SHA-256-locked adult Danio rerio photograph; and backs its core laws with 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_007_zebrafish_three_cell_stripes.lean`. Overall 92.1/100 (faithfulness 91.7, reproducibility 93.0); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 90, Parameter expressivity 91, Morphometric validation 92, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 92. Output judged: docs/media/zebrafish_three_cell_stripes_comparison.png: rendered output of 2009-nakamasu-zebrafish-three-cell-stripes.py at 8871db0, image/png, 1037223 B, 2133×1326 px, artifact_sha256 06e14d2e148a7cd75234ef8e7f3d3d203f925f5ca91afbcb6abe93be86da9902 (sha256 06e14d2e148a7cd75234ef8e7f3d3d203f925f5ca91afbcb6abe93be86da9902), spec_fingerprint e325ab05dbc489df59ad15e0ad7e5ce094c3a9ea9e524b654d3adbb036c29214. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: e325ab05dbc489df59ad15e0ad7e5ce094c3a9ea9e524b654d3adbb036c29214; artifact_sha256: 06e14d2e148a7cd75234ef8e7f3d3d203f925f5ca91afbcb6abe93be86da9902; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/zebrafish_three_cell_stripes/danio_rerio_specimen.jpg=850b2d4a94c7cbcb..., datasets/zebrafish_three_cell_stripes/scout_manifest.json=d19df92d7c80de8a..., datasets/zebrafish_three_cell_stripes/zebrafish_three_cell_stripes_reference.json=fcc1809ce2e992bc...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-zebrafish-three-cell-stripes-audit." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 3-species continuum PDE to discrete agent-based iridophore S-to-L shape transitions (Volkening & Sandstede 2015) across growing juvenile-to-adult zebrafish fins." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.921"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (Slot 007 autonomous loop assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

